msgid ""
"Your coach studies your Connect profile — your intention, your lifestyle, "
"what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"Dein Coach studiert Dein Connect-Profil — Deine Absicht, Deinen Lifestyle, "
"das, was Du suchst."

msgid ""
"Once a week, their pick takes over your Drop as the hero card — with a note "
"explaining why this person, for you."
msgstr ""
"Einmal pro Woche übernimmt seine Auswahl Deinen Drop als Hauptkarte — mit "
"einer Notiz, warum diese Person, für Dich."

msgid ""
"Say yes and your coach contacts you both to arrange the date. Decline and it "
"stays between you and your coach."
msgstr ""
"Sag Ja, und Dein Coach kontaktiert euch beide, um das Date zu organisieren. "
"Lehnst Du ab, bleibt es zwischen Dir und Deinem Coach."

msgid "See this week's pick"
