msgstr "Wer Dein Foto gut gelesen hat."

msgid ""
"A Spark isn't a like. It means someone looked at your card, guessed your 3 "
"answers from your photo — and got you right. Read them back to find out if "
"it's mutual: when you read each other well, your coach takes over and "
"arranges the date."
msgstr ""
"Ein Spark ist kein Like. Er bedeutet: Jemand hat Deine Karte gesehen, Deine "
"3 Antworten anhand Deines Fotos geraten — und Dich richtig gelesen. Lies "
"zurück und finde heraus, ob es beidseitig ist: Wenn ihr euch gut lest, "
"übernimmt Dein Coach und organisiert das Date."

msgid ""
"Someone reads your photo well (2 of 3 answers right) — you get a Spark, and "
"an email so you don't miss it."
msgstr ""
"Jemand liest Dein Foto gut (2 von 3 Antworten richtig) — Du bekommst einen "
"Spark und eine E-Mail, damit Du ihn nicht verpasst."

msgid ""
"Read them back: answer their 3 questions from their photo. Their card "
"unblurs the moment it's mutual."
msgstr ""
"Lies zurück: Beantworte die 3 Fragen der Person anhand ihres Fotos. Ihre "
"Karte wird scharf, sobald es beidseitig ist."

msgid ""
"Mutual read = match. Your coach contacts you both and arranges the date. "
"Pass instead, and they'll never know."
msgstr ""
"Beidseitig gelesen = Match. Dein Coach kontaktiert euch beide und "
