"This is our final reminder - your Crush.lu profile is still waiting for you!"
msgstr ""
"Dies ist unsere letzte Erinnerung - dein Crush.lu Profil wartet immer noch "
"auf dich!"

msgid ""
"We know starting something new can feel like a big step. But here's the "
