"Your Crush Coach tried to reach you for your profile screening call but "
"couldn't connect."
msgstr ""
"Dein Crush Coach hat versucht, dich für deinen Profil-Screening-Anruf zu "
"erreichen, konnte jedoch keine Verbindung herstellen."

msgid "What you need to do:"
msgstr "Was du tun musst:"

