"Lesebestätigungen"

msgid "Coach moderation flags on messages"
msgstr "Coach-Moderationsmerkmale bei Nachrichten"

msgid "3.7 Crush Spark Data"
msgstr "3.7 Crush-Spark-Daten"

msgid ""
"Crush Spark is our anonymous admirer feature. If you send or receive a "
